error[B0220]: this button has no accessible name
  --> t.beck:113:25
    |
113 |                         button(on_click=Toggle(id=t.id))
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ nothing announces what it does
    |
  = note: a button is named by its own text, or by `aria_label=` when it has none — an icon button is the usual case
  = help: give it text, `aria_label="…"`, or `a11y_exempt="…"` with a reason
